					"id": 230181501,
					"content": "嗯？这个药是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230181502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿夫塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 230181502,
					"content": "这是你的药。注意保持饮食清淡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230181503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230181503,
					"content": "唉，好，放心吧。我已经好些天<color=#00E1FFFF>没碰过肉</color>了，这样一定能更好地承接草神大人的恩惠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230181504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿夫塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 230181504,
					"content": "不过怎么感觉身体还不如以前了呢？唉，一定是时间还不够久…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿夫塔"
				}
			]
		},
